			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://hachyderm.io/@jobelenus\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>jobelenus</span></a></span> </p><p>&gt; Instead of freezing water into solid cubes, nugget ice makers rely on an auger system that forms tiny flakes of ice. Then, the flakes are collected and compacted into small nuggets.</p><p>&gt; Since each nugget is composed of minuscule, snow-like flakes, the resulting texture is light, airy, and addictive!</p><p><a href=\"https://robustkitchen.com/nugget-ice/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"\">robustkitchen.com/nugget-ice/</span><span class=\"invisible\"></span></a></p><p>basically, it yummy</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
